        "description": {
            "value": "<p>This dark, withered wood armor is crafted from the tree left behind when a dryad dies. Every step in crafting is a race to seal the magic inside before the wood rots away. The result is a <em>+1 wooden breastplate</em> that looks to be made of eternally decaying wood. The twisted nature of your armor allows you to [[/act demoralize]] animals and plants without taking a penalty if the creature doesn't understand your language.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Peel Bark</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (manipulate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You peel away a layer of dead wood. Attempt a flat check to end any persistent damage affecting your exterior (such as being on fire) as though you had an assisted recovery (@Check[flat|dc:10]).</p>"
